    12	 * the postcode (see {@link OwnerLocality#forPostcode}) and the first eight upper-case hex characters
    13	 * of SHA-256 over the normalized telephone (set by {@link BuildOwner}) concatenated with the last
    14	 * name. The code is a pure function of the owner's identity, so it carries no sequence number.
    15	 */
    16	public class AssignCustomerCode {
    17	
    18	    public void service(@Val Owner owner) {
    19	        String region = OwnerLocality.forPostcode(owner.getPostcode(), owner.getCity());
    20	        String hash8 = hash8(owner.getTelephone() + owner.getLastName());
